WEBVTT

00:07:27.893 --> 00:07:30.191
Actually, the theme
of this conference, I think,

00:07:30.215 --> 00:07:32.589
has hit on one of the major keys
to pull that off,

00:07:32.613 --> 00:07:34.803
and that's relationships
and working together.

00:07:34.827 --> 00:07:35.997
Thank you very much.

00:07:36.021 --> 00:07:39.332
(Applause)

00:07:39.356 --> 00:07:44.034
Chris Anderson: Larry, Larry -- wait,
wait, wait. Larry, wait one sec.

00:07:44.962 --> 00:07:47.344
I've got so many questions
I could ask you.

00:07:47.368 --> 00:07:49.305
I just want to ask one.

00:07:49.329 --> 00:07:51.183
You know, I could be wrong about this,

00:07:51.207 --> 00:07:54.831
but my sense is that
in the public mind today,

00:07:54.855 --> 00:08:01.256
GM is not viewed as as serious
about some of these environmental ideas